<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.4.5">
<l>poṉṉaikkoṇṭu raikalmītē niṟameḻa vuraittāṟpōl</l>
<l>uṉṉaikkoṇṭeṉ nāvakampāl māṟṟiṉṟi yuraittukoṇṭēṉ</l>
<l>uṉṉaikkoṇṭeṉ ṉuḷvaittē ṉeṉṉaiyu muṉṉiliṭṭēṉ</l>
<l>eṉṉappāveṉ ṉiruṭīkēcā veṉṉuyirk kāvalaṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Like taking gold and rubbing [it]</l>
<l rend="indent">on a touchstone so that [its] colour will appear,</l>
<l>I took you and placed [you] on my tongue,</l>
<l rend="indent">rubbing without change.</l>
<l>I took and placed you inside me.</l>
<l rend="indent">I placed myself in you.</l>
<l>My Father! My Hṛṣīkeśa! Guardian of my life!</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
